      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.1.1",
      "title": "Season start",
      "body": "● Each Season will start with the most up-to-date rules all documents will hold a change log and version number the version is equal to the year and the month the version was created\n● Over the course of that season, the Documents/ FAQ will be updated.\n● This may be due to spelling mistakes, rules not being written the best they can be, or new rules that have not been foreseen.",
