    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "depth": 2,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.2.1",
      "title": "Minor Change",
      "body": "A minor change involves rewording parts of the rules to make them clearer without changing how they are applied. The Committees will discuss and rewrite any rules.\nThese will be updated in the document on the website, including the date of publication and the document version. The updated documents will be sent to every registered member on our website. These changes are intended to clarify the rules, not to make major alterations.",
