    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "depth": 2,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.2.2",
      "title": "Major Change",
      "body": "For major changes, the Committees will draft the rules and present them to the Buhurt International Board, which will then discuss them with the National Organizations (NO).\nThese changes will be voted on by the NO.\n\nExamples of major changes include any modification with a direct impact on:\n● Allowed or prohibited techniques.\n● Points counting.\n● Technical requirements for armor and weapons (length, weight, etc.).\n● Any changes that have a financial impact on our members.",
