      "depth": 0,
      "kind": "note",
      "number": "2",
      "title": "Change log",
      "body": "This will be the change log of this document. It will be updated regularly and we will display what has been removed/added/reworded/formatted. This way we keep transparent communication and clarity about the rules\n\nMarch 2024 (Version update from 2024.03 to 2024.06)\n\nUpdate date: June-2024\n- clearification: 1.2.1 Minor change\n- clearification: 1.2.2 Major change Update date: March-2024\n- format: new design format, document will be used from now on.",
